  "notes": "Fundamental school (1re–9e AF) ends with the state exam of 9e AF; the four-year Nouveau Secondaire (Secondaire I–IV, NS1–NS4) ends with the Bac. Cycles: 1re–4e AF, 5e–6e AF, 7e–9e AF (MENFP confirms the 1st cycle is 1re–4e AF; the 2nd/3rd split follows the Bernard reform). Aliases keep the traditional names (Préparatoire I … Philo) still heard in many schools."
